	(descr "JST PH 2-pin side-entry THT connector S2B-PH-K-S (LCSC C173752), plug from +y. Two hole pairs: y=0 for a connector fitted on KiCad F, y=-3.0 for one fitted on KiCad B. The pairs are wired mirror-image so pin 1 keeps its net on both faces without jumpers (no double-bridge battery short possible). Default pin 1 = BAT_N (GND), pin 2 = BAT_P: CHECK YOUR BATTERY LEAD POLARITY. Hole/pad sizes from the JST PH datasheet / KiCad JST_PH_S2B-PH-K_1x02_P2.00mm_Horizontal.")
